1
00:00:00,150 --> 00:00:02,630
I just met myself,
and she can't speak.

2
00:00:02,630 --> 00:00:03,200
I'm Mara.

3
00:00:03,200 --> 00:00:05,550
The signs on my
street give warnings.

4
00:00:05,550 --> 00:00:06,890
This one has my face.

5
00:00:07,700 --> 00:00:09,490
There is only one
coat like this.

6
00:00:09,490 --> 00:00:10,820
And I'm wearing it.

7
00:00:10,870 --> 00:00:12,270
So is she. Awkward.

8
00:00:12,470 --> 00:00:13,440
Mom?

9
00:00:14,040 --> 00:00:14,900
That's not your mom.

10
00:00:14,900 --> 00:00:16,410
That's you, with worse hair.

11
00:00:16,610 --> 00:00:17,950
She opened her mouth.

12
00:00:17,950 --> 00:00:19,330
Nothing came out.

13
00:00:19,530 --> 00:00:20,800
So she bent glass.

14
00:00:20,800 --> 00:00:21,780
Fast, like me.

15
00:00:21,780 --> 00:00:21,990
No.

16
00:00:21,990 --> 00:00:23,420
Exactly like me.

17
00:00:24,310 --> 00:00:26,120
Vale? Our landlord, Mister Vale?

18
00:00:26,120 --> 00:00:27,280
He raised the rent.

19
00:00:27,280 --> 00:00:28,740
He's not a monster.

20
00:00:28,740 --> 00:00:30,100
He raised it twice.

21
00:00:31,100 --> 00:00:33,200
One leaves. What does that mean?

22
00:00:33,500 --> 00:00:35,230
Mara, my tubes feel funny.

23
00:00:36,040 --> 00:00:38,080
Good evening, Miss Reyes.

24
00:00:38,470 --> 00:00:39,320
You're early.

25
00:00:39,320 --> 00:00:42,550
I wasn't going to collect
you until tomorrow.

26
00:00:42,750 --> 00:00:44,350
Get away from my cat.

27
00:00:44,450 --> 00:00:45,780
Oh, this old thing?

28
00:00:45,780 --> 00:00:47,960
I have his fuse right here.

29
00:00:48,260 --> 00:00:49,970
Mara, I'm not scared. I'm just

30
00:00:50,030 --> 00:00:50,920
Zip?
